sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformAdmin
    participant Issuer
    participant RealEstateSecurityManager as Manager
    participant Investor

    %% Platform Initialization
    PlatformAdmin->>PlatformAdmin: Deploy IdentityRegistry
    PlatformAdmin->>PlatformAdmin: Deploy IdentityRegistryStorage
    PlatformAdmin->>PlatformAdmin: Deploy Compliance
    PlatformAdmin->>PlatformAdmin: Deploy ClaimTopicsRegistry
    PlatformAdmin->>PlatformAdmin: Deploy TrustedIssuersRegistry

    PlatformAdmin->>PlatformAdmin: Deploy VestingManager
    PlatformAdmin->>PlatformAdmin: Deploy SecondaryMarket

    %% Issuer Setup for New SPV/Property
    Issuer->>Issuer: Deploy ERC3643Token
    Issuer->>Issuer: Deploy DividendManager

    %% Deploy & Integrate SPV Components
    PlatformAdmin->>Manager: Deploy RealEstateSecurityManager(ERC3643Token, DividendManager)
    PlatformAdmin->>Manager: Link VestingManager
    PlatformAdmin->>Manager: Link SecondaryMarket

    %% Compliance Setup
    PlatformAdmin->>IdentityRegistry: Set IdentityRegistryStorage
    PlatformAdmin->>Compliance: Add ClaimTopicsRegistry
    PlatformAdmin->>Compliance: Add TrustedIssuersRegistry
    PlatformAdmin->>ERC3643Token: Set Compliance & IdentityRegistry

    %% Investor onboarding (at runtime)
    Investor->>IdentityRegistry: Submit identity claim
    Investor->>ERC3643Token: Purchase or receive tokens
